{"3897640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moonsteel", "steam_appid": 3897640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/c5314ec22ffe4a486942a6a0d2f0b28d.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1414 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the legendary shitgame series, here comes the next one: <i>Moonsteel</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo first-person horror game where you roam a vast forest infested with trolls out for your blood. Your one and only goal: survive and find the legendary sword hidden somewhere in the forest (its location changes every game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is especially long… and boring. The atmosphere is decent, but overall, it's a poor, slightly rushed experience with minimal customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So why am I releasing it ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because I know some of you are real tryhards who fear no grind and will do whatever it takes to find that sword and beat the game — no matter how long it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're still reading, here’s a more detailed description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A massive map</strong><br>Wander through a dark and creepy forest with no landmarks, stretching across kilometers. You’ll need to run — but wisely — manage your stamina, and above all, avoid crossing paths with the roaming monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/cd36ba96288936f5be009b27eb1bf172.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1600 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dangerous trio</strong><br>Three gigantic trolls patrol the forest and will attack as soon as they spot you. Crouch in time… or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/f112fc8b6e00aaf62cbcaa2528309d95.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1600 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A legendary sword</strong><br>A strange sound echoes from the blade. Find it as fast as you can to end the game. Patience and perseverance are your only allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/ef288e4ec22445abb620f37f3b115d27.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1600 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong><br>This is a boring, poorly made indie horror game. You’ve been warned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck !</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/c5314ec22ffe4a486942a6a0d2f0b28d.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1414 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the legendary shitgame series, here comes the next one: <i>Moonsteel</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo first-person horror game where you roam a vast forest infested with trolls out for your blood. Your one and only goal: survive and find the legendary sword hidden somewhere in the forest (its location changes every game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is especially long… and boring. The atmosphere is decent, but overall, it's a poor, slightly rushed experience with minimal customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So why am I releasing it ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because I know some of you are real tryhards who fear no grind and will do whatever it takes to find that sword and beat the game — no matter how long it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're still reading, here’s a more detailed description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A massive map</strong><br>Wander through a dark and creepy forest with no landmarks, stretching across kilometers. You’ll need to run — but wisely — manage your stamina, and above all, avoid crossing paths with the roaming monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/cd36ba96288936f5be009b27eb1bf172.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1600 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dangerous trio</strong><br>Three gigantic trolls patrol the forest and will attack as soon as they spot you. Crouch in time… or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/f112fc8b6e00aaf62cbcaa2528309d95.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1600 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A legendary sword</strong><br>A strange sound echoes from the blade. Find it as fast as you can to end the game. Patience and perseverance are your only allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/ef288e4ec22445abb620f37f3b115d27.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1600 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong><br>This is a boring, poorly made indie horror game. You’ve been warned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck !</p>", "short_description": "A solo shitgame where you wander a massive magical forest hunting for a sword, while trolls hunt you. Part horror, part boredom, all pain. Good luck, you'll need it.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/f77a7a012481fe896a95e6688163bd7dfac26f0b/header.jpg?t=1756124181", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/7847e4e521b9f2c2ce5fe7d51f3c9713aa765d4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756124181", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/7847e4e521b9f2c2ce5fe7d51f3c9713aa765d4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756124181", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 or AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Compatible DirectX</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class